Z||000006||Bruce||01-21-2000||10:23 PM||||Al,<BR>It's Flomaster #42583. As I recall, it was about $75 from R&E Racing. There was no shipping charge when I purchased it.<BR>I'll let you know how the installation goes.||||reg||1
